1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,300
一年最热的三伏天
The hottest days of summer

2
00:00:02,300 --> 00:00:04,600
徐州人排队喝滚烫羊汤
Xuzhou lines up for boiling mutton soup

3
00:00:04,600 --> 00:00:06,900
越热越吃羊，出一身透汗
Hotter days, more mutton, more sweat

4
00:00:06,900 --> 00:00:09,100
老徐州叫它"以热制热"
Locals call it "heat fights heat"

5
00:00:09,100 --> 00:00:11,400
伏天发汗，把暑气逼出来
Sweat now to drive out summer's heat

6
00:00:11,400 --> 00:00:13,700
乳白羊汤，香菜辣油一撒
Milky broth, coriander and chili oil

7
00:00:13,700 --> 00:00:16,000
这口伏羊食俗，已是国家级非遗
A national-heritage summer food custom

8
00:00:16,000 --> 00:00:18,300
徐州始祖彭祖，被尊中华厨祖
Pengzu of Xuzhou, China's first chef

9
00:00:18,300 --> 00:00:20,600
一碗羊汤，喝的是几千年
One bowl carries thousands of years

10
00:00:20,600 --> 00:00:22,900
所以最热的天，喝最烫的汤
So the hottest day, the hottest soup

11
00:00:22,900 --> 00:00:25,000
三伏天，你敢喝这一碗吗？
Dog days — would you dare a bowl?

12
00:00:25,000 --> 00:00:27,300
下集：不放一滴醋，酸掉一个省
